---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Warranty & Policies — Bez Ambar"
  description="Bez Ambar lifetime warranty on craftsmanship and materials. Quality jewelry backed by our commitment to excellence since 1979."
  canonical="https://bezambar.com/warranty"
>
  <main>
    <section class="warranty-hero">
      <h1>Warranty &amp; Policies</h1>
      <p>Quality craftsmanship backed by our commitment to excellence</p>
    </section>

    <div class="warranty-content">
      <section class="warranty-section">
        <div class="warranty-section-header">
          <div class="warranty-section-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="warranty-section-title">Lifetime Warranty</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="warranty-highlight">
          <h3>We Stand Behind Every Piece</h3>
          <p>Bez Ambar jewelry comes with a comprehensive lifetime warranty on craftsmanship and materials.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="warranty-section-body">
          <p>Every piece of Bez Ambar jewelry is protected by our lifetime warranty, reflecting our commitment to exceptional craftsmanship and quality materials.</p>

          <h4>Coverage Period</h4>
          <ul class="warranty-list">
            <li><strong>12 Months Full Coverage:</strong> Covers all defects in materials and craftsmanship from the purchase date</li>
            <li><strong>Ongoing Coverage:</strong> After the initial 12 months, warranty continues for the lifetime of the original owner with annual inspection at an authorized Bez Ambar service center</li>
          </ul>

          <h4>What Is Covered</h4>
          <ul class="warranty-list">
            <li>Defects in materials and craftsmanship</li>
            <li>Breakage of stones or prongs due to manufacturing defects</li>
            <li>Repairs and restoration to original condition</li>
          </ul>

          <h4>What Is Not Covered</h4>
          <ul class="warranty-list">
            <li>Damage from accidents, misuse, or negligence</li>
            <li>Unauthorized repairs or modifications</li>
            <li>Normal wear and tear, including surface scratches and patina</li>
            <li>Loss or theft</li>
            <li>Damage from improper care or storage</li>
            <li>Chemical or environmental damage</li>
          </ul>

          <h4>Warranty Terms</h4>
          <p>This warranty applies exclusively to the original purchaser and is non-transferable. To maintain warranty coverage after 12 months, your jewelry must be inspected annually at an authorized Bez Ambar service center. We recommend professional cleaning and inspection at least once per year.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="warranty-section">
        <div class="warranty-section-header">
          <div class="warranty-section-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"/>
              <path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="warranty-section-title">Security &amp; Privacy</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="warranty-section-body">
          <p>Your privacy and security are our highest priorities. We are committed to protecting your personal information and ensuring safe transactions.</p>

          <h4>Secure Transactions</h4>
          <ul class="warranty-list">
            <li>All transactions are protected with industry-standard SSL encryption</li>
            <li>Your payment information is processed securely through trusted gateways</li>
            <li>We never store full credit card details on our servers</li>
          </ul>

          <h4>Data Protection</h4>
          <ul class="warranty-list">
            <li>Personal information is never sold or shared with third parties without your explicit consent</li>
            <li>Your data is used solely for order fulfillment, customer service, and communication</li>
            <li>We maintain strict confidentiality of all customer information</li>
          </ul>

          <h4>Your Privacy Rights</h4>
          <p>We comply with all applicable privacy laws. For full details on how we collect, use, and protect your data, see our <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="warranty-section">
        <div class="warranty-section-header">
          <div class="warranty-section-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/>
              <polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="warranty-section-title">Conditions of Use &amp; Copyright</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="warranty-section-body">
          <p>All content, design, and intellectual property on bezambar.com are the exclusive property of Bez Ambar Inc. and are protected by international copyright and trademark laws.</p>

          <h4>Intellectual Property Rights</h4>
          <ul class="warranty-list">
            <li>All designs, images, text, and multimedia content are copyrighted by Bez Ambar Inc.</li>
            <li>Reproduction, distribution, or transmission without written consent is strictly prohibited</li>
            <li>You may view and print content for personal, non-commercial use only</li>
          </ul>

          <h4>Proprietary Designs</h4>
          <p>Bez Ambar's signature diamond cuts are proprietary designs protected by intellectual property law, including the Blaze&reg; cut and Elysian Cut&trade;.</p>

          <h4>Website Terms</h4>
          <p>By using bezambar.com, you agree to comply with all applicable laws and regulations. Bez Ambar reserves the right to modify content and policies at any time without notice.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="warranty-cta">
        <h3>Have Questions About Your Warranty?</h3>
        <p>Our customer service team is here to assist you with any warranty claims or inquiries.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="warranty-cta-btn">Contact Us</a>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
